{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Inside, inside, INSIDE!","Find somewhere to hide! Go on, all of you!","Everybody inside right now, don't stop to look","Lock it lock it LOCK IT!","Is it locked? IS IT LOCKED?","Under the bed, go, go, under the bed!","In the bathtub, get in the bathtub, pull the curtain","Try to stay out of sight. Stay low","Find a place to hide, quick, GO","Behind the Dumpster, quick, behind it, get low!","RUN!","Not a sound!","This way, come on!","Don't you look back, DON'T!","Move your feet, move, MOVE!","Quiet, quiet, no one breathe...","Shh, shh, keep quiet, please!","Where do we GO?","Ma'am! This way! Come on!","Keep back! Don't let anything grab you!","Oh no, hide, I've got to hide, where do I hide?","Get low, get lower, flatter, flatter","Don't stand there, move","Everyone in, everybody in, is everybody in","Just let me iiin, please let me in, please, PLEASE!","Hurry, hurry, it's coming, it's coming this way...","We're not safe here, we have to go, now, NOW","I can't breathe, go without me, hide, you hide","Faster, FASTER, it's right there","Did it see us go in? Did it SEE us?","Keep hold of my hand, don't let go, whatever happens don't let go!","Grab Grandma, grab her other arm, we're going!","Let them in, we have to let them in- no, we can't, we CAN'T","Hurry up hurry up hurry UP!","Psst, quiet, quiet! Don't give yourself away!","Behind the church, behind it, get down behind it!","Not there, it's open there, THERE, behind the shelves!","Lord, hide us, Lord, hide us, hide us...","Run, Debbie, RUN, don't wait for me!","I can't find the key, I can't find the key, where's the key?!","Out the back, they're at the front!","Oh God, it's going for the neighbors' house, GET DOWN!","Wait! Wait for me! Don't go without me!","I want to go home, I'm not safe here...","The yard! Not the yard! Anywhere but the yard!","Mama, Mama, hold me, hold me, hold me...","Nonono, don't hide there, that's the first place they'll look-","The dog's still out there! Leave him! No, get him, no!","I hear it scratching, I hear it scratching on the wood!","Stay down! Don't make a sound!","Storm shelter! The storm shelter, I've got the key!","The camper! Get in the camper, I've got the key!","Easy... don't make a sound"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Bolt it, chain it, every lock we've got","Push something against it, anything heavy, push!","Don't slam it, shut it quiet, quiet...","Get in the back, all the way in the back!","Leave it, leave the bag, leave EVERYTHING, go","Just go, don't think!","Hold your breath, hold it, it's right outside!","Is it safe in there? I don't know if it's safe in there","Not that house, not that one, THIS one, this one's got a- come on","Anywhere, just get out of the open, I don't care where","Lights! Every light in the house, off, OFF!","Get out of sight if you can, go!","My legs won't, you go, go on, hide, go","Keep quiet, please, they might hear!","We need to go, we have to GO, we can't stay put!","Close it, close the gate behind you!","Biscuit! Get Biscuit inside, GET HER!","I'm not coming out, you can't make me","Hand over your mouth, don't breathe on the glass","Over here, over here, there's room, squeeze in","Where's the back way out? There's gotta be a back way out","Middle of the room, away from the edges!","Count to a hundred and don't make a sound, ready, one","Behind me, everyone behind me, then in","Try that one, try that house, try it, maybe nobody's home","Please let someone's house be open, please","Under a blanket, get under a blanket, don't let it see you","Wait for it to pass, wait, nobody moves, wait!","Hush that radio, hush it, turn it all the way down!","Stay back from the front, back from the front room!","Wait till you hear it go... wait... not yet...","Where's your other shoe? Forget it, forget the shoe, GO","The church! The church is open, run for the church!","Fort Knox, they'll let us in at the fort, they have to","Get in, don't say a word...","Find somewhere to hide! Help each other!","Pull the shades, pull them all, hurry!","The freezer room, the walk-in, in the walk-in, move!","Pull your feet in, tuck them up, don't let them show...","Crouch down, no peeking, not even one peek!","Just a minute, give me a minute, I can't run, I'm sorry!","Down the hill, go, get low on the way!","Did you lock it? You didn't lock it, did you? Go back, no, don't go back!","Hide the food, hide it, if someone sees food they'll want in!","Easy, nice and easy, one at a time, everyone through!","Get on your belly, flat as a pancake, stay flat!","Nope, can't, can't be here, we have to find somewhere else-","Is anybody home? ANYBODY? Please open up, please!","Keep it quiet. We don't need any more trouble","Don't look out, you'll draw it, just don't look!","It's gonna break it down, it's gonna break the whole thing down!","Back up, there's another one, there's two!","Where's Daddy? Is Daddy coming?!","Not that way! That's where they came from, THAT way!","Roll under, roll, roll, tuck in-","Dear Jesus, let the lock hold...","Run in a line, don't scatter, a LINE!","Try to find somewhere they can't see us!","Lock yourselves in and don't come out till I knock four times...","Library, the library, nobody ever goes in the library...","Springhouse, down the hill, the springhouse!","Not the church, that's the first place anybody would look!","Walk in like it's a regular day, don't run, just walk in","Keep quiet... please, just for a moment","Everybody hold your breath, now go!","Under the pew, under it, little ones first","Cover the little ones with coats, put your coats over them","Behind the freezers, they're loud, nobody hears us!","Hide in plain sight, stand still, just stand like a mannequin"}},
