{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear|world=door",{"Shut the door! SHUT THE DOOR!","Get the door, get it!","Hold the door, hold it with me!","It's trying the door, trying the DOOR!","Don't open it, don't open it for anyone, not for ANYBODY!","That's Pete, that's Pete's voice, let him in!","That's not Pete, step BACK from the door!","Open up! Open the door! They're behind me!","The fire station! They've got a steel door! Run for the fire station!","Away from the glass doors!"}},
