{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=building",{"In the basement, get down the basement, hurry","The attic, go to the attic, pull the hatch shut","Get in the pantry, squeeze in","Lock yourselves in the bathroom, I'll hold the hall","Down in the cellar, everybody, count heads on the way down!","Get the mattress up against the wall, higher!","Church basement, everybody in the church basement, quietly!","I'm locking myself in the bathroom, I'm sorry","Put your hand on the wall, follow it, find the corner!","Under the sink, under the sink, I fit, I fit in there..."}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear|world=inside",{"In here! In here, quick, IN HERE!","There's no more room in here, there's no room, I'm sorry, I'm so sorry!","Why's it so hot in here? Why can't I breathe?","I can't breathe in here, I can't, open it, no, don't open it!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Find somewhere safer! Don't draw attention to us!","Shoes off, walk soft, soft as you can-","No flashlight, put it out!","The tobacco barn! Go to the barn, nobody ever checks the barn!","Culvert, there's a culvert past the field, go!","One at a time, go on, quick, quick, quick!","Go through, I'll pull it shut behind us!","Get your boots on and your bag, we may have to bolt!","The feed store has a back office, it's got a lock, in!","Shut it, lock it, don't let those things follow us!","Tack room, the tack room's got a bar across it","Tool shed, squeeze in with the mower, go!","Take your keys out of your pocket, they jingle...","Who has asthma? Do you have your inhaler? Do you?"}},
