{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,2|mood=fear",{"Folks, get inside, get indoors, NOW!","Try to find somewhere safe. Help each other!","Dispatch, I'm taking shelter in the nearest building, I'm going in!","Move, move, MOVE, I've got the rear!","Inside! I said inside! Everyone INSIDE!","Lock it down! Lock down the whole building!","Tell them to get down behind something solid!","Run if you have to, but run THAT way, away from them!","Behind me, everybody behind me, move back slow","Get them in the gym, get them in the gym, it's the biggest thing around...","Get down! Get in! Get out of the open! Somebody GO!","Quiet, everybody quiet, I can hear it right outside!","Tell them to stop crying, they have to stop, please, tell them","Stay down! Wait a second!","Quick! Under the desks, GO!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|world=window",{"Go home, lock your doors, stay away from the windows"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,2|mood=fear|world=road",{"Clear the street, everybody off the street!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4",{"Into the nearest building, anything with a lock, go","Back into your homes, everyone, that's an order","Fall back to the station, move, we're falling back","Everybody into the station, we lock it down","Get the shotguns out of the rack, load them, then wait!","This way, folks, follow me, right behind me","Single file, calmly, don't run, nobody runs","You, sir, take her arm, get her in, go","Dispatch, we're pulling back to the station, repeat, pulling back","Heads down, move steady, I'm right behind you!","Everybody keep your voices down, no lights, no radios","Everyone up, everybody up, we're not staying out here","Don't use the sirens, no lights, no sirens, they follow noise","Folks, I need you quiet and I need you still, please","Come on, let's go, up, move","Get to the courthouse, the old one, it's got stone walls","Take the jail, the jail's got bars on everything","Lights off in the station, no one on the radio!","Knock on every house, tell them all to stay in, lock up","Take the high school, lock the gym","Pharmacy's got a back room, nobody'll see you in there!","Move the filing cabinets, stack them against the front"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|world=road",{"Nobody out on the roads, nobody, get off them"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,2|mood=fear|world=vehicle",{"Take cover! Behind the cruiser, go!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|mood=fear",{"Barricade the front, move the desks, move EVERYTHING","All units, fall back to the courthouse!","Cover me, I'm going to the radio","Go, go, I've got your back, GO","Keep them quiet in there, keep them QUIET, we don't want attention","Ma'am, ma'am, I need you to calm down and walk, just walk","Try to find somewhere safe. Don't go wandering!","Where do I put them? Where do I put forty people?","Oh God, the back's open, someone shut the back, SHUT it!","I don't have enough bullets for this, so we hide, understand? We hide","Away from the front, get back from the front, stay back","Find somewhere to hide. I'll try to help","Where's a key? Does anybody have a key to the back?","One more person, one more, squeeze in, squeeze, squeeze!","We're sitting ducks out here, we have to move","Church is open, go to the church, go, go","Heads below the windowsills, everybody, stay below the sills","The hospital's closer, take them to the hospital, go","Nobody leaves, nobody comes in, until I've heard from county","Stay out of sight. Don't draw their attention","Where the hell are we going to put them? Where do we put everybody?","Slide the bolt, slide it, quietly, QUIETLY"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,2|mood=fear|world=door",{"Hold the door, hold it, HOLD IT!"}},
{"PANIC_DAY_HIDE","reg=law,swat|day=0,4|mood=grim",{"We'll hold in there, as long as we can, as long as we can","I can't protect a town from out here, I need to get these people inside!","Nobody leaves the building until I say so, nobody","First time in eleven years I've told people to run from something","When this is over I'm taking a very long vacation","I can't guard a whole town, so I'm going to guard this one building","Let the radio go quiet, noise draws them, we go quiet too"}},
